%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5b124c880b6f43a4b856fab0c65ce040, type: 3}
  m_Name: HowToPlayPages
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  pages:
  - title: Moving and aiming
    text: Move with WASD. Your character faces your cursor, and that's where your
      shots go. Scroll the mouse wheel to zoom the camera in or out. Your shots are
      more accurate when you stand still, so stop for a moment before a long shot.
    picture: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c7a379147ed6da147bb7775a3e48f95e, type: 3}
  - title: Shooting and overheat
    text: 'Left click fires your weapon. Every shot builds heat, and so does sprinting.
      Fill the bar and you overheat: no shots and no abilities until it cools all
      the way down. Partway through an overheat a small window opens on the bar.
      Press R inside it to vent and get back into the fight sooner.'
    picture: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a19e311976fa1924e9649c1a33336989, type: 3}
  - title: Ability slots
    text: 'You carry four tools: your weapon on left click, an attachment on right
      click, a movement ability on Shift and an ultimate on Space. You start with
      a pistol and buy the rest in the shop. The ultimate charges as you deal damage,
      take damage and take part in kills, and it only fires when the meter is full.
      You can upgrade your armor twice; each upgrade either lets it take more damage
      or makes it recharge sooner.'
    picture: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f0ed4ce77673397479ba202a6ef11802, type: 3}
  - title: Vision
    text: You see in a cone toward your cursor, plus a small circle around you. Walls
      block your sight; short barriers don't. Your teammates share what they see,
      so you can stay together or split up to scout. Everything outside your team's
      sight goes dark, and enemies in the dark are hidden. You can still hear their
      guns when they shoot close by.
    picture: {fileID: 21300000, guid: edd03d2852d0839459cdc4ba8e5e86ce, type: 3}
  - title: The shop
    text: 'Press P to open the shop. It has two pages: weapons with their upgrade
      tree, and abilities and armor. Rest your cursor on an item to see what it does.
      You can sell a weapon or armor back for part of what you paid; swapping an
      ability gives nothing back. When and where you can buy depends on the game
      mode, so check its info in the lobby.'
    picture: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 85a5df7d87709ee45b92df4a3513e085, type: 3}
  - title: Capturing zones
    text: Stand inside a zone's circle to capture it. Bring teammates and it goes
      faster. If enemies stand in it too, the capture holds until only one team is
      left. Walk away halfway and the progress fades slowly instead of vanishing.
      An enemy can only drain a zone you own while none of your team is inside it.
    picture: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 437a27b7a1f608a4b8aea9a1af16262f, type: 3}
